From ec6f01c7ee678c506f5b0acaa2f98fa1d9a48b9a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 10:15:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] WIP: mdns-sd as a workspace of its own, with upstream's
 examples and tests; formatting

cargo fmt --all walks path dependencies, and found the vendored crate's
declared example and test targets missing; they are upstream's files and
vendored as they are. A fourth mdns-sd patch gives the crate an empty
[workspace], as rqs_lib has, so that a checkout nested in another Cargo
workspace still loads.

